    "innovation": "Using large-eddy simulations, this paper shows that climate warming weakens aerosol-cloud interactions in subtropical marine stratocumulus, attenuating the aerosol-induced cooling effect by over 30% in a doubled-CO2 climate by inhibiting adjustments to cloud fraction and liquid water path.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
