            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "Using the Morrison microphysics in the SAM model, the cloud droplet size distribution is assumed to be a Gamma distribution. The number and mass mixing ratios of cloud liquid are predicted, and the Gamma parameter is fixed to a value of 10.3 85.",
